msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Sega SSF/DSF Audio Decoder"
msgstr "Sega SSF/DSF audio dekoder"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Sega Saturn Sound Format (SSF) and Dreamcast Sound Format (DSF) is an audio format based on PSF. It stores audio ripped from the ROMs of Sega Saturn and Sega Dreamcast games."
msgstr "Sega Saturn Sound Format (SSF) i Dreamcast Sound Format (DSF) su audio formati zasnovani na PSF-u. Pohranjuju audio zapise ripovane iz ROM-ova igara Sega Saturn i Sega Dreamcast."

